<title>USA: DI Industries holders approve restructure.</title>
<headline>DI Industries holders approve restructure.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>DI Industries Inc said on Wednesday that its shareholders approved the company's previously announced restructuring program that includes the issuance of 79.1 million shares of stock for new rigs and cash.</p>
<p>At the company's annual meeting, shareholders also approved increasing the authorized number of shares to 300 million from the present 75 million share authorization.</p>
<p>Shareholders approved issuing the shares in exchange for 18 ultra-deep drilling rigs and $25 million in cash, the company said.</p>
</text>
